          *
          * Every form on this page posts to `#outcome`, and attaching,
          * nudging or acknowledging happens far down a long list, so the
          * answer has to be somewhere the browser can send the reader. That
          * part was right and the placement was not: this sat at the top of
          * `.wrap`, outside `{account && …}`, so a message about one card
